<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cox Comm raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cox Comm raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said analyst Rick Westerman upgraded Cox Communications Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- sees company delivering compound annual cash flow growth of 12 percent over the next five years.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $26. Shares rose 1/2 to 20-7/8.</p>
</text>
